lowers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896397378", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580#issuecomment-2896397378", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580", "id": 2896397378, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6so4RC", "user": {"login": "liu12344321", "id": 182083927, "node_id": "U_kgDOCtphVw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182083927?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321", "html_url": "https://github.com/liu12344321", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-05-21T02:43:38Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-21T02:43:38Z", "body": "@julianoes Im using PX4.\nI want to implement the following use case: the drone is originally flying in mission mode, and my onboard vision computer monitors the environment. When an obstacle is detected, it will intervene and interrupt the mission. Once the obstacle is cleared and it's safe to proceed, I want to resume the mission.\n\nThe problem lies in resuming the mission. For example, initially I send set_manual_control_input(0, 0, 1, 0) to take control. Then, when I want to hand control back to the mission, I set set_manual_control_input(0, 0, 0.5, 0) and immediately call mission.start_mission(). After that, I continuously send set_manual_control_input(0, 0, 0.5, 0).\n\nHowever, the resumed mission gets interrupted again right away. I believe this is because the earlier manual control input set_manual_control_input(0, 0, 1, 0) is still considered active by the flight controller. To avoid this, I have to wait a few hundred milliseconds after sending the first set_manual_control_input(0, 0, 0.5, 0) before calling mission.start_mission().\n\nIt seems like mission.start_mission() is being sent after but received before the manual control command by the flight controller.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896397378/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "liu12344321", "id": 182083927, "node_id": "U_kgDOCtphVw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182083927?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321", "html_url": "https://github.com/liu12344321", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/followers", "following_url": "https