ttps://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/events/17744506882", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "event": "subscribed", "commit_id": null, "commit_url": null, "created_at": "2025-05-21T02:43:39Z", "performed_via_github_app": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896470423", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580#issuecomment-2896470423", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580", "id": 2896470423, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6spKGX", "user": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-05-21T03:44:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-21T03:44:42Z", "body": "Ok, I think manual_control is not the right interface to do this. Instead, I would pause the mission using `mission_pause` which will go into hold.\n\nOr, alternatively if you want to do some control to avoid the obstacle, I would do that in offboard mode, e.g. using velocity commands.\n\nManual control is really meant for \"manual\" as in human control, and not automated control like that.\n\nAlso, PX4 implements an interface for obstacle avoidance that we probably should use instead, however, it's not implemented by MAVSDK yet, and I also don't know what the state of it is in PX4, but I do know that it would be the right thing to do, at least long term.", "author_association": "COLLABORATOR", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896470423/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "julianoes", "id": 1419688, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MTk2ODg=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1419688?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes", "html_url": "https://github.com/julianoes", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/julianoes/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896486887", "html_url": "https://github.com/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580#issuecomment-2896486887", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2580", "id": 2896486887, "node_id": "IC_kwDOBabE0s6spOHn", "user": {"login": "liu12344321", "id": 182083927, "node_id": "U_kgDOCtphVw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182083927?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321", "html_url": "https://github.com/liu12344321", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2025-05-21T03:59:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-05-21T03:59:57Z", "body": "@julianoes Because my drone is a VTOL operating in fixed-wing mode, it cannot hold position in place. So, when an obstacle is detected, I cannot simply switch to a HOLD mode. Instead, the onboard computer must automatically control the drone to fly toward a safe, obstacle-free area and resume mission. Although this is implemented via manual control commands as if a human were flying the drone, it is actually the onboard system issuing the commands autonomously.\nI checked PX4's obstacle avoidance feature, and it currently only supports multicopter mode\uff0cso I want to implement an onboard computer to interrupt the mission when necessary and resume it when it's safe. But I have to add a delay of several hundred milliseconds  before resuming the mission, which is very troublesome.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/comments/2896486887/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null, "event": "commented", "actor": {"login": "liu12344321", "id": 182083927, "node_id": "U_kgDOCtphVw", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182083927?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321", "html_url": "https://github.com/liu12344321", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu12344321/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/liu1